# ROOFCAT: a grounded cat carried by the auto-scroll must not shimmer.
# At SCROLL 0.5 the camera steps 0,1,0,1 whole pixels. The carried cat has to
# move by exactly the same whole-pixel steps, so its drawn screen x stays put
# (it used to alternate between two columns every frame, which looked blurry
# on the Vita). Two frames of running first knock the cat off the camera's
# half-pixel phase, which is what exposed the bug.
game roofcat
wait 5
cheat area 0 1
cheat clear_foes
cheat cam 0
wait 30
hold RIGHT 2
wait 2
cheat jitter_reset
wait 240
expect grounded == 1
expect spirit == 0
expect jitter == 0
expect cam_bad == 0
expect cam > 100
# running and holding back is fine, but riding along again must be steady
hold RIGHT 7
hold LEFT 3
wait 2
cheat jitter_reset
wait 120
expect jitter == 0
expect cam_bad == 0
